# Paths ripgrep (and the Grep tool) skip. Git still tracks everything here;
# this only keeps code searches from returning generated or bulk content.
# Search one of these on purpose with `rg --no-ignore-dot <pattern> <path>`.

# Embedded IDE bundle, regenerated by `pnpm orca:web` from packages/ide.
apps/web/public/orca/

# Lockfiles and vendored dependency patches.
pnpm-lock.yaml
packages/ide/pnpm-lock.yaml
packages/ide/config/patches/

# ui-ux-pro-max's dataset; query it through its search.py script.
.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/data/

# 200 KB+ scheduler ledger; read it directly when you need it.
docs/collaborative-ide/COLLABORATIVE_IDE_TASK_STATE.md
